   "kind": "slide",
   "title": "A signal does nothing unless something receives it.",
   "label": "Background",
   "html": "<div class=\"col\"><div class=\"a eyebrow\" style=\"--i:0\">Background</div><h1 class=\"t h-m\"><span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:0\">A</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:1\">signal</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:2\">does</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:3\">nothing</span></span> <span class=\"acc magenta\"><span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:4\">unless</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:5\">something</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:6\">receives</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:7\">it.</span></span></span></h1><ol class=\"stepper\"><li class=\"a \" style=\"--i:3\"><span class=\"big-idx\">01</span><p>A tumour grows faster than its own blood supply.</p></li><li class=\"a \" style=\"--i:4\"><span class=\"big-idx\">02</span><p>It sends a signal for new blood vessels: angiogenesis.</p></li><li class=\"a \" style=\"--i:5\"><span class=\"big-idx\">03</span><p>More receivers means more blood vessels, and more for the drug to block.</p></li></ol><div class=\"a \" style=\"--i:7\"><p class=\"quote\">That is why KDR is our target, and why reading it without surgery would be useful.</p></div></div><div class=\"viz\" aria-hidden=\"false\"><svg class=\"viz-svg angio\" viewBox=\"0 0 808 860\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Schematic: a tumour sends a signal; receivers (VEGFR-2) on the vessel wall; new blood vessels grow towards the tumour; bevacizumab blocks the signal\"><defs><radialGradient id=\"tum\" cx=\"40%\" cy=\"40%\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFC24B\"/><stop offset=\".55\" stop-color=\"#FF6FA8\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#B0206A\"/></radialGradient></defs><circle class=\"tumour pop\" cx=\"230\" cy=\"470\" r=\"128\" fill=\"url(#tum)\"/><path class=\"vessel draw\" d=\"M808,250 C700,250 640,300 560,330 S430,380 380,420\" pathLength=\"1\" style=\"--d:0\"/><path class=\"vessel draw\" d=\"M808,520 C720,520 660,500 590,480 S450,470 390,470\" pathLength=\"1\" style=\"--d:1\"/><path class=\"vessel draw\" d=\"M808,700 C700,700 650,650 590,600 S470,560 400,520\" pathLength=\"1\" style=\"--d:2\"/><path class=\"vessel draw\" d=\"M680,250 C640,200 600,190 560,200\" pathLength=\"1\" style=\"--d:3\"/><path class=\"vessel draw\" d=\"M650,700 C620,760 580,780 540,770\" pathLength=\"1\" style=\"--d:4\"/><line class=\"wall draw\" x1=\"610\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"610\" y2=\"720\" pathLength=\"1\"/><g class=\"rec pop\" style=\"--d:0\" transform=\"translate(600,290)\"><path d=\"M0,0 L-26,-18 M0,0 L-26,18 M0,0 L22,0\"/><circle cx=\"-28\" cy=\"-19\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"-28\" cy=\"19\" r=\"5\"/></g><g class=\"rec pop\" style=\"--d:1\" transform=\"translate(600,380)\"><path d=\"M0,0 L-26,-18 M0,0 L-26,18 M0,0 L22,0\"/><circle cx=\"-28\" cy=\"-19\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"-28\" cy=\"19\" r=\"5\"/></g><g class=\"rec pop\" style=\"--d:2\" transform=\"translate(600,470)\"><path d=\"M0,0 L-26,-18 M0,0 L-26,18 M0,0 L22,0\"/><circle cx=\"-28\" cy=\"-19\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"-28\" cy=\"19\" r=\"5\"/></g><g class=\"rec pop\" style=\"--d:3\" transform=\"translate(600,560)\"><path d=\"M0,0 L-26,-18 M0,0 L-26,18 M0,0 L22,0\"/><circle cx=\"-28\" cy=\"-19\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"-28\" cy=\"19\" r=\"5\"/></g><g class=\"rec pop\" style=\"--d:4\" transform=\"translate(600,650)\"><path d=\"M0,0 L-26,-18 M0,0 L-26,18 M0,0 L22,0\"/><circle cx=\"-28\" cy=\"-19\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"-28\" cy=\"19\" r=\"5\"/></g><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:0; --y:350px\"/><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:1; --y:395px\"/><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:2; --y:440px\"/><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:3; --y:485px\"/><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:4; --y:530px\"/><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:5; --y:350px\"/><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:6; --y:395px\"/><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:7; --y:440px\"/><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:8; --y:485px\"/><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:9; --y:530px\"/><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:10; --y:350px\"/><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:11; --y:395px\"/><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:12; --y:440px\"/><circle class=\"sig\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"7\" style=\"--d:13; --y:485px\"/><g class=\"drug pop\" style=\"--d:6\" transform=\"translate(470,360)\"><path d=\"M0,0 L-14,-14 M0,0 L-14,14 M0,0 L16,0\"/></g><g class=\"drug pop\" style=\"--d:7\" transform=\"translate(478,455)\"><path d=\"M0,0 L-14,-14 M0,0 L-14,14 M0,0 L16,0\"/></g><g class=\"drug pop\" style=\"--d:8\" transform=\"translate(486,550)\"><path d=\"M0,0 L-14,-14 M0,0 L-14,14 M0,0 L16,0\"/></g><text x=\"230.0\" y=\"650.0\" class=\"lab big\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tumour</text><text x=\"430.0\" y=\"300.0\" class=\"lab\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Signal</text><text x=\"800.0\" y=\"140.0\" class=\"lab\" text-anchor=\"end\">Receiver · VEGFR-2</text><text x=\"800.0\" y=\"850.0\" class=\"lab\" text-anchor=\"end\">New blood vessels</text><text x=\"40.0\" y=\"790.0\" class=\"lab lime\" text-anchor=\"start\">Bevacizumab blocks the signal</text></svg></div>",
   "notes": "Here is the biology, in short. A tumour grows faster than its own blood supply. So it sends out a chemical signal that makes your body build new blood vessels into it. We call this angiogenesis. You can see it growing inward here. But a signal does nothing unless something receives it. More receivers means more blood vessels, and more for the drug to block.   [tekan pelan] That is why KDR is our target, and why reading it without surgery would be useful.",
   "notes_id": "Begini biologinya, singkatnya. Tumor tumbuh lebih cepat daripada pasokan darahnya sendiri. Jadi dia mengirim sinyal kimia yang membuat tubuh Anda membangun pembuluh darah baru ke dalamnya. Ini namanya angiogenesis. Terlihat tumbuh ke dalam di sini. Tapi sinyal tidak berarti apa-apa kalau tidak ada yang menerimanya. Makin banyak penerima, makin banyak pembuluh darah, dan makin banyak yang bisa diblokir obat.   [tekan pelan] Itulah kenapa KDR jadi target kami, dan kenapa membacanya tanpa operasi akan berguna.",
   "bridge": "That leaves one question. How.",
   "direction": "Biologi, lurus saja, jangan dibikin puitis. Tunjuk gambar waktu menyebut pembuluh darah.",
   "budget": 60,
   "time": "1:45–2:45",
