   "title": "Validation design",
   "label": "Backup · Validation design",
   "html": "<div class=\"col\"><div class=\"a eyebrow\" style=\"--i:0\">Backup A · Validation design</div><h1 class=\"t h-m\"><span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:0\">Validation</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:1\">design</span></span></h1><div class=\"a \" style=\"--i:2\"><div class=\"compare\"><div><h3>Non-nested</h3><p>Screening and tuning fitted on the full cohort.</p><p class=\"val-l\">AUC 0.687 ± 0.081</p></div><div><h3 class=\"magenta\">Nested</h3><p>Both confined to each outer training fold.</p><p class=\"val-l magenta\">AUC 0.497 · 95% CI 0.346–0.648 · accuracy 48.4%</p></div></div></div><div class=\"a \" style=\"--i:3\"><p class=\"aside\">Median split z = −0.179 · 46 HIGH / 45 LOW</p></div></div><div class=\"viz\" aria-hidden=\"false\"><svg class=\"viz-svg auc\" viewBox=\"0 0 808 860\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AUC: non-nested 0.687 ± 0.081 versus nested 0.497 (95% CI 0.346–0.648); 0.5 means guessing\"><line class=\"grid\" x1=\"90.0\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"90.0\" y2=\"660\"/><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"700.0\" class=\"tick\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.3</text><line class=\"grid\" x1=\"218.0\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"218.0\" y2=\"660\"/><text x=\"218.0\" y=\"700.0\" class=\"tick\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.4</text><line class=\"grid\" x1=\"346.0\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"346.0\" y2=\"660\"/><text x=\"346.0\" y=\"700.0\" class=\"tick\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.5</text><line class=\"grid\" x1=\"474.0\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"474.0\" y2=\"660\"/><text x=\"474.0\" y=\"700.0\" class=\"tick\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.6</text><line class=\"grid\" x1=\"602.0\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"602.0\" y2=\"660\"/><text x=\"602.0\" y=\"700.0\" class=\"tick\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.7</text><line class=\"grid\" x1=\"730.0\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"730.0\" y2=\"660\"/><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"700.0\" class=\"tick\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.8</text><text x=\"410.0\" y=\"748.0\" class=\"lab caps\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AUC</text><line class=\"chance draw\" x1=\"346.0\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"346.0\" y2=\"670\" pathLength=\"1\"/><text x=\"336.0\" y=\"186.0\" class=\"lab amber\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.5 means guessing</text><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"274.0\" class=\"lab big\" text-anchor=\"start\">Non-nested</text><line class=\"ci draw slate\" x1=\"481.7\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"689.0\" y2=\"320\" pathLength=\"1\" style=\"--d:0\"/><line class=\"cap slate\" x1=\"481.7\" y1=\"308\" x2=\"481.7\" y2=\"332\"/><line class=\"cap slate\" x1=\"689.0\" y1=\"308\" x2=\"689.0\" y2=\"332\"/><circle class=\"pt-auc slate pop\" cx=\"585.4\" cy=\"320\" r=\"15\"/><text x=\"790.0\" y=\"274.0\" class=\"lab slate\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.687 ± 0.081</text><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"534.0\" class=\"lab big\" text-anchor=\"start\">Nested</text><line class=\"ci draw magenta\" x1=\"148.9\" y1=\"580\" x2=\"535.4\" y2=\"580\" pathLength=\"1\" style=\"--d:1\"/><line class=\"cap magenta\" x1=\"148.9\" y1=\"568\" x2=\"148.9\" y2=\"592\"/><line class=\"cap magenta\" x1=\"535.4\" y1=\"568\" x2=\"535.4\" y2=\"592\"/><circle class=\"pt-auc magenta mover\" cx=\"342.2\" cy=\"580\" r=\"15\" style=\"--from:243.2px\"/><text x=\"790.0\" y=\"534.0\" class=\"lab magenta\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.497 · 95% CI 0.346–0.648</text><path class=\"gap draw\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M342.2,420 L342.2,432 L585.4,432 L585.4,420\"/><text x=\"463.8\" y=\"466.0\" class=\"lab lime big\" text-anchor=\"middle\">+0.190</text></svg></div>",
