   "html": "<div class=\"col\"><div class=\"a eyebrow\" style=\"--i:0\">Backup C · Protein structure</div><h1 class=\"t h-m\"><span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:0\">VEGFR-2</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:1\">kinase</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:2\">domain,</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:3\">PDB</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--k:4\">2OH4.</span></span></h1><ol class=\"stepper tight\"><li class=\"a \" style=\"--i:2\"><span class=\"big-idx\">01</span><p>Eight ATP-binding residues within 5 Å of the inhibitor.</p></li><li class=\"a \" style=\"--i:3\"><span class=\"big-idx\">02</span><p>Gatekeeper Val914</p></li><li class=\"a \" style=\"--i:4\"><span class=\"big-idx\">03</span><p>DFG motif Asp1044/Phe1045</p></li><li class=\"a \" style=\"--i:5\"><span class=\"big-idx\">04</span><p>Numbering offset by two from UniProt.</p></li></ol><div class=\"a \" style=\"--i:6\"><p class=\"aside\">Qualitative visualisation supplying molecular context rather than a mechanistic bridge to the imaging model.</p></div></div><div class=\"viz\" aria-hidden=\"false\"><canvas class=\"viz-canvas\" data-viz=\"protein\" width=\"808\" height=\"760\"></canvas><p class=\"viz-cap\"><span class=\"sw lime\"></span>Inhibitor <span class=\"sw white\"></span>Val914 · Asp1044 · Phe1045 <span class=\"muted\">— VEGFR-2 kinase domain, PDB 2OH4</span></p></div>",
